@startuml
!include ../../common/eztrade-style.puml

title EZTrade - Contexto del sistema

actor "Usuario final\n(inversor/trader)" as User
actor "Desarrollador/a" as Dev

rectangle "EZTrade\nPlataforma web de trading" as System EZ_BACKEND {
  component "Frontend\nNext.js + React" as Frontend EZ_FRONTEND
  component "Backend\nSpring Boot + Spring Modulith" as Backend EZ_BACKEND
}

database "MySQL local\nBase EZTrade" as MySQL EZ_DB
component "Alpha Vantage API\nprecios, busqueda, overview, velas" as Alpha EZ_EXTERNAL
component "GitHub Actions\nCI backend Maven" as GHA EZ_DEVOPS

User --> Frontend : Navega, opera,\nrecibe notificaciones
Frontend --> Backend : REST JSON\nJWT Bearer
Frontend --> Backend : WebSocket/STOMP\n/ws, /user/queue/notifications
Backend --> MySQL : JPA/Hibernate\nDDL auto update
Backend --> Alpha : HTTPS RestClient\nAPI key + throttle
Dev --> GHA : push / pull_request\na main
GHA --> Backend : mvn -B clean verify\nworking-directory EZTrade/backend

note right of System
Evidencia: frontend/package.json, frontend/lib/api-client.ts,
backend/pom.xml, application.properties, .env.example,
AlphaVantageAPI.java y ../.github/workflows/maven.yml.
end note

note bottom of GHA
No se han encontrado Dockerfile, docker-compose,
Nginx, Terraform, Kubernetes ni scripts de despliegue
para la aplicacion.
end note

@enduml
